<!DOCTYPE html><html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
  <title>CreaTop: Simplified Topology Builder</title>
<meta content="text/html; charset=ISO-8859-1" http-equiv="Content-Type"/></head>

<body>
  <!--Aquí inicia la part corresponent al titol de la MSA. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<h1><span id="wpstitol"/></h1>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent titol de la MSA editable de el WPS.-->
 This program integrates and makes easier the process of building topology done by
  the VECPNT, LINARC, CICLAR and ATRIPOL modules of MiraMon. Nevertheless, you
  should be aware about the limitations of this simplified module. Concretely,
  to do some tasks as:

  <ul>
    <li>cycling different polygons upon the same arcs layer.</li>

    <li>using different types of tolerances during the process of topology
    building (Node snap tolerance, Undershoot tolerance, etc).</li>

    <li>controlling how to deal with multiple records in the attributes
    database corresponding to the same graphical object.</li>

    <li>etc.</li>
  </ul>the user should use the specific programs listed before and to control
  the whole set of parameters. However, in many typical cases, specially when
  digitizing has been performed with MiraMon using the tools for connecting
  graphical objects, Creatop provides three options:<br/>
  <br/>
  <!--Aquí inicia la part corresponent a les opcions de de la MSA. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<span id="wpsopcions"/>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent a les opcions de de la MSA editable de el WPS.--> 
